  InputLines:
    - '// @input SceneObject fieldVisual {"hint":"The big quad the waves are drawn on: an object with a RenderMeshVisual using your Wave_Mat (a flat 1 x 1 cm quad such as Pad_Plane.mesh). Keep it DISABLED in the scene; this script enables it only while a wave is alive, sizes it (cm) and lays it flat on the stage. Empty = no shared waves."}'
    - '// @input Component.Camera testCamera {"hint":"Preview testing only: the Camera used to turn a mouse click into a spot on the table. Assign your main Camera. With it set, clicking in the Preview window starts a wave where the click lands on the stage plane (needs Shared Wave Field ON). Empty = mouse test off (key 8 and the test loop still work). Ignored on a device."}'
